# Student Performance Prediction 🎓

## Overview

A beginner-level Machine Learning project that predicts whether a student will pass or fail based on academic performance, study time, and absences.

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Scikit-learn
- Google Colab

## Dataset

UCI Student Performance Dataset (`student.csv`).

## Features Used

- Previous_Total (G1 + G2)
- Study Time
- Absences

## Machine Learning Algorithm

Logistic Regression

A Scikit-learn Pipeline was implemented using StandardScaler and Logistic Regression.

## Model Performance

- Accuracy: 86.08%
- Evaluation: Confusion Matrix

## Concepts Learned

1. Dataset loading and preprocessing
2. Feature engineering
3. Binary classification
4. Train-test splitting
5. Logistic Regression
6. Feature scaling
7. Scikit-learn Pipelines
8. Model evaluation

## Project Status

Completed initial Logistic Regression model. Further improvements and algorithm comparisons are planned.

